/-
Finite arithmetic interface for sometik179's height-14–100 certificates.
This module contains only the original data structures and ordinary numeric
definitions required to state the four certificate-verification theorems.
The mathematical and finite validation proofs are supplied separately.
Source: Prove2Me c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a (2026-10-03).
Theta/Mellin foundations in that source are attributed to Gabewhigham.
-/
